---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Untitled Walk" description="Untitled Walk, installation, 2021. Rice paper, projection mapping. Spring Street Studio, Los Angeles.">
  <article class="project">

    <header class="project-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">installation · 2021</span>
      <h1 class="display-xl project-title">Untitled Walk</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image">
      <img
        src="/images/Untitled_walk_april_2021/IMG_9717.jpg"
        alt="A person in silhouette faces a dark wall of hanging rice-paper squares, each lit with projected footage of leaves and blossoms"
        class="hero-img"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="project-body">

      <p class="lead">
        I project onto rice paper because the image reads from both sides. You can walk around it and stand behind it and still be inside the picture, so the image becomes something you have a physical relationship with. Here the projections were videos I shot in the State Historic Park next door, hung so that visitors moved between them. I wanted the plants outside to come inside, and for people to notice where they were standing while it happened.
      </p>

      <div class="project-video">
        <video
          class="content-vid"
          poster="/images/Untitled_walk_april_2021/Untitled_Walk_Documentation_poster.jpg"
          aria-label="Untitled Walk, documentation video"
          controls
          playsinline
          preload="metadata"
        >
          <source src="/images/Untitled_walk_april_2021/Untitled_Walk_Documentation.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="image-pair">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/Untitled_walk_april_2021/0C20EC9D-B5FB-49AC-9E8A-2369DE733E22.JPG"
            alt="The empty room: rice-paper squares of different sizes hung on thin wire, glowing with projected greenery"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/Untitled_walk_april_2021/IMG_9690.jpg"
            alt="A person standing among the hanging squares, projected leaves falling across their face"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">year</span>
        <span class="meta-value">2021</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">medium</span>
        <span class="meta-value">installation: rice paper, projection mapping</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">venue</span>
        <span class="meta-value">Spring Street Studio, Los Angeles</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--page-padding-x) var(--space-8);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .project-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    min-height: 340px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-body {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .project-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-video {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    max-width: 420px;
    margin: var(--space-4) auto;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-vid {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .image-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
  .image-pair .project-image {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .image-pair .content-img {
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .project-meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--gold);
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .project {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--page-padding-x-sm) var(--space-7);
    }
    .image-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .meta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
